# What must never reach the build context.
#
# The first two entries are the ones that matter: node_modules is hundreds of
# megabytes of platform-specific binaries that the image rebuilds anyway, and
# appsettings.Development.json holds a real connection string.

**/node_modules
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/*.env

**/bin
**/obj
**/dist
**/.vite
artifacts/
src/App/wwwroot/

.git
.github
.vs
.idea
.vscode

local/
docs/
tests/
deploy/.data/
**/TestResults
**/coverage

*.md
!README.md
